---
// Snippets keyword demo (#2816): the trigger word cycles in scripts/features/keyword-demo.js.
---

<div class="keyword-demo" data-keyword-demo>
  <span class="eyebrow">Your spoken keyword</span>
  <p class="keyword-lead">Every shortcut starts with a word you choose.</p>
  <div class="keyword-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>Say</span><span class="keyword-input"><span data-keyword-text>backslash</span><i></i></span></div>
  <p class="keyword-follow">then your snippet name, and it’s pasted.</p>
  <div class="keyword-example">“<span data-keyword-example>backslash</span> my address”</div>
  <p class="keyword-caption">Change it anytime. Make it sound like you.</p>
  <span class="sr-only">Choose your own keyword, such as backslash, shortcut, or insert. Say it before your snippet name to paste your saved text.</span>
</div>
